== Description ==

'''Gunpowder''' is an item in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Biochemical Workbench]]. It appears as an ingredient in 35 downstream recipes at the [[Gunsmith Workbench]], including [[5.56x45mm Chrome]], [[D45 Chrome]], [[7.62x51mm Chrome]], [[7.62x39mm Chrome]], [[7.62x54mm Titanium]], [[7.62x51mm Titanium]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

